{"id":"17-3108-2-34","zh":"在未来时中，根据“karassa sappaccayassa kāho”这条规则里所用的“带词缀”一词，bhuj 之后的 ssa 替换为 kha；再按“ko khe cā”，词根末音变为 k，并作元音加强：bhokkhati、bhokkhanti。","confidence":70}
{"id":"17-3108-35-38","zh":"bhokkhasi、bhokkhatha。","confidence":90}
